<section class="stats"><div class="container stats-grid"><div><strong>01</strong><span>Employee</span></div><div><strong>Gauteng</strong><span>South Africa</span></div><div><strong>ICT</strong><span>Business Solutions</span></div><div><strong>24/7</strong><span>Connected operations</span></div></div></section>

<section id="about" class="section"><div class="container two-col"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT MAFUBE</div><h2>Modern ICT, built around your business.</h2><p>Mafube ICT Services is focused on delivering practical technology solutions that help businesses communicate, collaborate and operate efficiently.</p><p>The original website highlights IP Telephony, Video Conferencing, Call Centre Solutions, Instant Messaging, Voice Recordings, Email/Fax/SMS, Voice Mail, Presence and Telephony Management. These capabilities have been retained and reorganised into a modern solution portfolio.</p></div><div class="about-panel"><div class="mini-icon">M</div><h3>Our approach</h3><p>Understand the requirement → design the solution → supply and configure → support the environment.</p><ul><li>Business communication</li><li>Connectivity & networking</li><li>Cloud and workplace technology</li><li>IT products and support</li></ul></div></div></section>

<section id="services" class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">SERVICES</div><h2>Technology services for the connected business</h2></div><p>From IP telephony to IT infrastructure, Mafube can help you assemble the right technology stack.</p></div>
<div class="cards">
  <article class="card"><div class="icon">☎</div><h3>Hosted PBX & VoIP</h3><p>Cloud-based business telephony, extensions, SIP/VoIP connectivity and IP deskphones.</p><a href="#contact">Discuss PBX →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="icon">◎</div><h3>IP Telephony</h3><p>Business calling environments with IP phones, extensions, call handling and telephony management.</p><a href="#contact">Discuss telephony →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="icon">▣</div><h3>Unified Communications</h3><p>Presence, instant messaging, voicemail, voice recordings and collaboration capabilities.</p><a href="#contact">Discuss UC →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="icon">◉</div><h3>Contact Centre</h3><p>Call-centre solutions designed around customer communication, agents and reporting requirements.</p><a href="#contact">Discuss contact centre →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="icon">⌁</div><h3>Connectivity</h3><p>Fibre, internet, LTE/5G and business connectivity options, subject to availability and partner coverage.</p><a href="#contact">Request connectivity →</a></article>
  <article class="card"><div class="icon">▤</div><h3>IT Products & Support</h3><p>Computers, peripherals, networking equipment, accessories and practical IT support services.</p><a href="#contact">Request IT solution →</a></article>
</div></div></section>

<section id="solutions" class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOLUTIONS</div><h2>One partner, multiple technology layers</h2></div></div><div class="solution-grid">
<div class="solution"><span>01</span><h3>Communications</h3><p>Hosted PBX, Yealink-compatible IP phones, VoIP, SIP and business calling.</p></div>
<div class="solution"><span>02</span><h3>Collaboration</h3><p>Video conferencing, instant messaging, presence, voicemail and recordings.</p></div>
<div class="solution"><span>03</span><h3>Connectivity</h3><p>Fibre, internet, LTE/5G and network infrastructure for connected sites.</p></div>
<div class="solution"><span>04</span><h3>IT Infrastructure</h3><p>Laptops, desktops, peripherals, networking, accessories and cloud-enabled workplaces.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="gallery" class="section alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">GALLERY</div><h2>Connected technology</h2></div></div><div class="gallery"><div class="visual visual-pbx"><span>HOSTED PBX</span><strong>Business Voice</strong></div><div class="visual visual-video"><span>VIDEO</span><strong>Collaboration</strong></div><div class="visual visual-network"><span>NETWORK</span><strong>Connectivity</strong></div><div class="visual visual-it"><span>IT</span><strong>Workplace Technology</strong></div></div></div></section>

<section class="cta"><div class="container cta-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow">LET'S CONNECT</div><h2>Tell us what your business needs.</h2><p>We can help you scope a communication, connectivity or IT solution.</p></div><a class="btn light" href="#contact">Contact Mafube</a></div></section>

<section id="contact" class="section contact"><div class="container contact-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">CONTACT</div><h2>Start a conversation</h2><p>Send your requirement and Mafube ICT Services can follow up with the appropriate solution discussion.</p><div class="contact-list"><div><strong>Email</strong><a href="mailto:info@mafubeservices.co.za">info@mafubeservices.co.za</a></div><div><strong>Telephone</strong><span>011 070 8666</span></div><div><strong>Mobile</strong><span>082 597 6262</span></div><div><strong>Address</strong><span>74 Lyndleigh 11 Kevin Road, Southdale 2091, Gauteng</span></div><div><strong>Website</strong><span>www.mafubeservices.co.za</span></div></div></div>
<form class="contact-form" action="mailto:info@mafubeservices.co.za" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><label>Name<input name="name" required></label><label>Company<input name="company"></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>What do you need?<textarea name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="Hosted PBX, VoIP, fibre, IT equipment, Microsoft, support..."></textarea></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send enquiry</button><small>This form opens your email client. Connect it to a server-side form service before production if you need web-based submissions.</small></form></div></section>
